          "Available deployment evidence is incomplete across all services, but the observed release is unrelated and the failure is configuration-specific."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "recommended_actions": [
      "Update the custom Slack OAuth app so its redirect setting matches the auth config callback URI, not the short per-connection link.",
      "Retest a new Cedar connection after correcting the redirect URI.",
      "Preserve existing healthy connections; scope remediation to new connection setup rather than rotating all live credentials.",
      "Monitor Cedar new-connection failure rate and queue depth after configuration correction to confirm impact clears."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "No canonical production connection records were returned, so 'existing connections remain healthy' is supported by the complaint/reproduction pattern rather than direct connection-state telemetry.",
      "Deployment evidence shows an unrelated dashboard release but does not exhaustively prove no other unobserved changes existed.",
      "Empty refresh-history and connections queries do not prove absence of related events."
